Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Ark of Sirius?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.13,0:00:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The light...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the mountain we were headed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to catch up with them quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.91,0:00:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time you started listening to your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mikhail, end the life of the Sirius with your own hands, {He could be referring to the sirius in general or Yuliy specifically here.}{in that case, this is how it needs to be written, since plural would be Sirius'. I may have written that plural incorrectly earlier in the show.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and then bring the bloodstained Ark to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.14,0:03:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy{**-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.26,0:03:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you guys are here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.22,0:03:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.77,0:03:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it on the way here in an abandoned vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.74,0:03:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This wireless telegraph is something you need, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy{**-kun}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.19,0:03:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get the Ark?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.35,0:03:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Ark?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.19,0:03:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All for the sake of this thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.50,0:03:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans and vampires hunted it so feverishly,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and Dad sacrificed his life to seal it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.91,0:03:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy{**-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.74,0:03:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear more, but we don't have time for a long conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.99,0:03:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.05,0:03:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a huge airship outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be Yevgraf's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.87,0:03:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard was waiting for Yuliy to undo the seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:03:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The vampires, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.58,0:04:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, let's run—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,As the last living Sirius,\NI need to settle the score myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy{**-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.14,0:04:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there, Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you go on a suicide mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're going to have to leave the Ark here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost to Karafuto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just fly us straight to the mountain range.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,First Dogville, and now Karafuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy sure is making us go to a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Might I ask why you sound so happy while saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.23,0:04:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I {\i1}am{\i0} looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I always love a good rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.01,0:04:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not ready to open up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.31,0:04:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.39,0:04:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything too reckless, Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.21,0:04:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bishop{**-san}?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.93,0:04:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're finally showing your true colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. British Intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Japanese Intelligence shouldn't be taken lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You needed to lead him here and have him undo the Ark's seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.67,0:05:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that why you brought him to meet Captain Akasaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was the most roundabout thing I've ever done in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.99,0:05:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But if only a Sirius could undo the seal, what else could I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.14,0:05:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea that Britain had gathered that much information on the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world has its eyes on that Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.52,0:05:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just the first to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.54,0:05:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You can drop the act now, Bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd already noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.74,0:05:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That you weren't a Jaeger,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and that you certainly aren't a British spy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.59,0:05:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So you knew all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.30,0:05:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.20,0:05:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:06:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you knew I was a vampire,\Nwhy did you agree to work with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.69,0:06:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,In your eyes I saw regret from not being able to save your team,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.13,0:06:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and guilt from outliving them by getting turned into a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to find the Ark before Yevgraf does,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.27,0:06:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}break it before his very eyes, and then break {\i0}him{\i1}.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,At that moment, I didn't detect even the slightest trace of lies or deceit in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.65,0:06:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but try believing in you.{So much so that I decided to try believing in you.}{i have no idea how to phrase this... "so much so" doesn't quite work since the previous line is a negative}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.94,0:06:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.93,0:06:32.96,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,What kind of tripe...{OK, hear me out. The point is that he's using a derogatory term to call him naive, right? "Kid" doesn't get that across (especially since it can be a term of endearment), and I can think of no other form of address that does.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.37,0:06:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.52,0:06:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't hide anything from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All my dead buddies...{It's all my buddies who died you see.}{}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get their faces out of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that I'm a vampire, I could have them stuck in there for all eternity now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately for me, there's that weird-ass disease going around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I don't lift a finger, all of them,\Nincluding me, will just drop dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.19,0:07:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost sounds too good to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But now the Ark of Sirius is in the mix,\Nwhich might be able to do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.76,0:07:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell I'm going to let them get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to settle the score yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't just your problem anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Both me and these two are already involved!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.03,0:07:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to play the big action hero by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me settle my score too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.31,0:07:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.23,0:07:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lend me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to work with a vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.63,0:07:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.07,0:07:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,With Bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.30,0:07:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I found Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.35,0:07:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Uncle Cowboy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.84,0:07:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about him, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.50,0:08:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If things get bad, it's going to be every man for himself{alt: I'm not going to be able to help you out}, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy, look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.09,0:08:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We brought Misha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We can finally all play together!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.43,0:08:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.96,0:08:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother{*Nii-san}?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.80,0:08:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.42,0:08:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:26.06,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Are we going to play battle-to-the-death? {You're up}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:27.65,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Let me join, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.26,0:08:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother{*Nii-san}, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.53,0:08:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you not hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.31,0:08:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.57,0:08:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Misha wouldn't listen to\N{*}Lord Yev{*Yev-sama}, so he got punished!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be like this until {*}Lord Yev{*Yev-sama} tells him he can stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the blood pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Vampires can't disobey the master that made the pact with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.09,0:08:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He let Misha do whatever he wanted before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Misha's fault for getting too full of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.99,0:08:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.93,0:08:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:08:58.65,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,That idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.65,0:08:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's he leaving us behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.27,0:09:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going! You can't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.70,0:09:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, he got caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.77,0:09:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.14,0:09:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.45,0:09:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, {*}Brother{*Nii-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.17,0:09:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.85,0:09:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ark is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's shining!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Misha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep playing with Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be back after we give this to {*}Lord Yev{*Yev-sama}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.45,0:09:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Bishop?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.68,0:10:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you're still hanging around?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.64,0:10:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job's already—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.45,0:10:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the Ark to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.59,0:10:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Bishop...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.42,0:10:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I talked to Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I found out everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What the Ark is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.09,0:10:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason that Dad left Dogville with the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And I made a promise to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.78,0:10:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised to prove...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.56,0:10:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to prove that we can achieve the new pride of the Sirius that Dad yearned for!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.22,0:11:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd only hold him back if we tried to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.19,0:11:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{*}Brother{*Nii-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.39,0:11:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.24,0:11:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I ever end up like him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.81,0:11:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want you to be the one to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{*}Brother{*Nii-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.43,0:11:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do I have to kill you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kill {\i0}you{\i1} with my own hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.71,0:11:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.19,0:11:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.62,0:11:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.25,0:11:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see me now?{subtle but I think it works}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.09,0:11:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.31,0:12:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All we needed was for you,\Nthe last Sirius, not to step foot in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.17,0:12:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.63,0:12:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother{*Nii-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.22,0:12:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to meet Dad and undo the Ark's seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bishop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.64,0:12:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did you kill Larissa? You're one of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I ever wanted to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.55,0:12:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Eternal life?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Becoming a "more noble" lifeform?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.51,0:12:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's worth less than shit to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you say that after you made the blood pact? {Is she saying that the blood pact (at least for Royals) is done consensually?}{Dunno, and there are plenty of different interesting ways to unpack this line so I'm not so interested in narrowing it down}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.19,0:12:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I want to suck blood for the rest of my life? I'm not a goddamned mosquito!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.27,0:12:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Babies get to suck on better stuff!{no clue how to get this better across because i can't think of this idea as being good in the first place. replaced shit because of the somewhat unappetizing literal image}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of the ancient laws of the Sirius,\Nany who learned of the Ark or wished to take it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,were to be buried along with their knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.21,0:12:54.19,Default,,2,2,0,,Dad sealed the Ark because he thought that we'd never be able to coexist with other races if it were around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was missing the bigger picture!{}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.05,0:12:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ark is the pride of the Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.99,0:13:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not something we should seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's something that should exist as part of our pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going to face this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.14,0:13:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.23,0:13:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.12,0:13:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.39,0:13:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to live with the Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That was my promise to Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.69,0:13:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.50,0:13:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I swore I would protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about the Sirius or the Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.93,0:13:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All of that is my duty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have done it, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.86,0:13:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother{*Nii-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your older brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.65,0:13:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Becoming a vampire didn't change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I was always worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.92,0:13:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your brother too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:57.54,Default,edit_tmr,0,0,0,,You have a little brother who loves you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.56,0:13:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.82,0:14:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I do nothing when my brother is suffering so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.97,0:14:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother{*Nii-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.44,0:14:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't glare at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.06,0:14:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send you chasing right after your partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to break it right here and now, but I don't think he'd be very happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.59,0:14:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.80,0:14:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,From its radiance, I can see that it received the blood of a Sirius, as the ancient text instructed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.55,0:14:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not handle it roughly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.74,0:14:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The loss of what you are holding would not be something you could make up for with your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.98,0:14:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.43,0:14:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:14:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.10,0:15:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.69,0:15:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No! We're staying together even if you try to fight me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.09,0:15:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as stubborn as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.38,0:15:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.95,0:15:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not going to be able to be together for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.90,0:15:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.58,0:15:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The fatal disease that only vampires can catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.11,0:15:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no other way for me to escape the blood pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.29,0:15:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bishop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.14,0:15:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're Mikhail's little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.42,0:15:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my thanks for unsealing the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.79,0:15:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Outstanding work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:16:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you too excited to wait in the ship like a good boy, Yevgraf?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.88,0:16:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So {\i1}he's{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.06,0:16:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I got bored of waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.96,0:16:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a very long time since my patience last failed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.80,0:16:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess in the end I couldn't help you much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.03,0:16:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But lemme tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When you talked about believing in me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and about not working with a vampire,\Nbut working with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I was pretty damn happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.42,0:16:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bishop...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're beating the hell out of Yevgraf, make sure you hit him a few times for—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What a foolish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Deemed worthy by the blood pact,\Nbut unable to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:03.48,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Mikhail, it seems you're cut from the same cloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you suck the blood of the infected?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.47,0:17:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll finally be able to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed that you can bluster while teetering so obviously on the edge of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.24,0:17:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All for your darling brother, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.06,0:17:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,However, playing with you comes {\i1}after{\i0} the release of the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ark will awaken from its long slumber and be opened!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.07,0:17:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time in five thousand years, the knowledge of the Sirius will be made manifest!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel truly fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.61,0:17:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely the souls of the wolves who died in Dogville will feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy Jirov,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.71,0:17:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,there is no end to my gratitude toward you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.82,0:17:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When I obtain the wisdom of the Ark,\NI'll let you stay by my side as a pet dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be the last of the Sirius breed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take very good care of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.20,0:17:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.68,0:18:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you're just a mangy wolf, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.60,0:18:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you'd prefer dying as you crawl on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.07,0:18:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yevgraf!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.09,0:18:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That will be a very Sirius-like end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.86,0:18:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.24,0:18:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Help those two deal with the ones here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go after Yevgraf!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all because I took the Ark from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.23,0:18:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't make up for that,\Nthen what kind of big brother am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.09,0:18:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in no condition to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.87,0:18:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.15,0:18:37.49,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.49,0:18:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just listen to me for once!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.69,0:18:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't{**, Nii-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.14,0:18:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,At least take me—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.37,0:18:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, can we deal with more immediate problems before you have your sibling's quarrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.91,0:18:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that it's going to be very easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,True enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.84,0:18:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:19:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Die with honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.30,0:19:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,V Shipping?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.11,0:19:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Mister Willard?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.86,0:19:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy! Kept you waiting, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.43,0:19:21.14,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,I told you to bring us through {\i1}gently{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.14,0:19:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make this performance a loud one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.45,0:19:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah! Here we go for another pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.69,0:19:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.65,0:19:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother{*Nii-san}?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother{*Nii-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.55,0:19:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming to—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.41,0:19:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy{**-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.54,0:19:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.57,0:19:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,May victory be yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.43,0:19:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ryouko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.34,0:20:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just call me by my... {Iba's fucking face}{He's a Ryoukofag and was annoyed that she wasn't going to use her sword herself, but he got a cute shipping moment so he was satisfied}{4chan lingo OUT}{60 more episodes at this rate and they might become an actual item}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This giant won't get the hell off of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fallon, throw him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.02,0:20:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask the impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.27,0:20:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can barely keep us in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.52,0:20:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yevgraf has obtained the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.18,0:20:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's on that airship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.01,0:20:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy's following him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.37,0:20:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly toward the airship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind bringing the goliath beetle up there with us, no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.58,0:20:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose this is as far as we can follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.34,0:20:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ark of Sirius that has existed since time immemorial...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:21:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The time for its canopy to open has finally come!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ark will become my body,\Nand my body will become the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.83,0:21:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,After five thousand years, you will manifest today!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.77,0:21:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I will become the Ark of the Sirius—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.03,0:21:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the Ark of the Vampires!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.61,0:21:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The canopy has opened!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.01,0:23:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Ark can't be left in the hands of the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.20,0:23:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I finally found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.30,0:23:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The thing that I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.86,0:23:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My own path!
